{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"t":"Reading","x":0.84151304495768353,"y":0.059479367882010692,"w":0.084463621775309194,"h":0.019122659528213237,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.086419751102158715,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"Questions 32-36","y":0.10895170803982557,"w":0.17901234944661459},{"w":0.3703703816731771,"c":1,"t":"Choose the correct letter, A, B, C or D.","y":0.14389534922359404,"h":0.018943284509881253,"x":0.086419747330351696},{"y":0.17864910266680201,"x":0.086355756789732202,"h":0.018691550997317341,"t":"Write the correct letter in boxes 32-36 on your answer sheet.","w":0.57830668131510421,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.21360748548377273,"t":"32 What point does the writer emphasise in the first paragraph?","x":0.084298082449690004,"w":0.61949071248372412,"h":0.020399041956529751},{"w":0.46323633829752608,"y":0.24065211032888756,"h":0.01959192570303292,"c":1,"x":0.17683482388262875,"t":"how dramatically our reactions to music can vary"},{"w":0.49588475545247396,"t":"how intense our physical responses to music can be","x":0.17695474151022889,"y":0.2601744184441539,"h":0.01750520486011653,"c":1},{"w":0.018518517812093099,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"C","y":0.27906976724254795,"x":0.12962962989282176},{"h":0.014534882858869502,"c":1,"t":"D","y":0.29505813978422801,"x":0.13168724283283376,"w":0.016460905075073251},{"x":0.17695473888264057,"w":0.51440327962239585,"t":"how little we know about the way that music affects us","c":1,"y":0.27761627891513974,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"x":0.17683235565347671,"y":0.29237433487897069,"h":0.020496532408733392,"c":1,"t":"how much music can tell us about how our brains operate","w":0.54761525472005212},{"y":0.32267441844295774,"w":0.82921808878580716,"h":0.017441860778592999,"x":0.082304535881483787,"c":1,"t":"33 What view of the Montreal study does the writer express in the second paragraph?"},{"x":0.17680268854920361,"t":"Its aims were innovative.","w":0.23902832031249999,"y":0.34998143361666312,"h":0.01637837968248923,"c":1},{"x":0.12962962987996168,"c":1,"w":0.018518517812093099,"t":"B","y":0.36918604630063556,"h":0.013081395583944833},{"y":0.38662790676575198,"t":"C","w":0.018518517812093099,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.12962962987996168},{"x":0.12962962987996168,"c":1,"w":0.018518517812093099,"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"D","y":0.40406976716589638},{"x":0.1769547388357583,"y":0.36918604636232133,"h":0.01598837238037687,"w":0.31893002827962241,"t":"The approach was too simplistic.","c":1},{"y":0.38662790682605497,"t":"It produced some remarkably precise data.","x":0.17695473382928284,"w":0.40740740458170566,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1},{"x":0.17695472801003434,"h":0.016034596379148613,"c":1,"t":"The technology used was unnecessarily complex.","w":0.4732510375976563,"y":0.40547703166793614},{"w":0.032921810150146488,"t":"34","h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"x":0.080246913760001148,"y":0.43023255793436432},{"y":0.43168433445497945,"w":0.72633743286132812,"t":"What does the writer find interesting about the results of the Montreal study?","c":1,"x":0.12551441106980368,"h":0.017443572674538999},{"c":1,"t":"the timing of participants' neural responses to the music","w":0.5308642069498698,"h":0.017441859655301539,"x":0.17489711393247254,"y":0.4578488374397911},{"y":0.47433846807435731,"h":0.02033559846372579,"t":"the impact of the music on participants' emotional state","w":0.52492828369140621,"x":0.17272692340132456,"c":1},{"x":0.12962962966410946,"w":0.016460905075073251,"c":1,"t":"C","h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.49563953468440847},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"y":0.51308139512227191,"x":0.12962962966410946,"w":0.016460905075073251,"c":1,"t":"D"},{"h":0.018989507947007378,"w":0.63580245971679683,"t":"the section of participants' brains which was activated by the music","x":0.1748971221734946,"y":0.4926383984016991,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.51295641949669946,"h":0.016195524146054074,"t":"the type of music which had the strongest effect on participants' brains","x":0.17489711108908182,"w":0.66460906982421875},{"x":0.080246913734940459,"w":0.032921810150146488,"y":0.54069767422742732,"c":1,"h":0.014534883982160851,"t":"35"},{"x":0.11103372155700821,"t":"Why does the writer refer to Meyer's work on music and emotion?","c":1,"y":0.53791959770855402,"w":0.64012583414713542,"h":0.020228789186870877},{"x":0.17283949733177636,"w":0.44650207519531249,"h":0.015988372380376759,"y":0.56831395333906565,"c":1,"t":"to propose an original theory about the subject"},{"x":0.17283950606523471,"t":"to offer support for the findings of the Montreal study","c":1,"h":0.016195524146054185,"w":0.5,"y":0.58568904593231708},{"c":1,"w":0.56995885213216146,"t":"to recommend the need for further research into the subject","y":0.60453474699335996,"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.17283950387219088},{"w":0.018518517812093099,"x":0.12757201671123744,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"D","y":0.62209302304482161,"c":1},{"y":0.62209302310883385,"h":0.016010628150966988,"x":0.17283950451202826,"w":0.62139918009440109,"c":1,"t":"to present a view which opposes that of the Montreal researchers"},{"y":0.65842167234387627,"x":0.080246920045118103,"t":"36 According to Leonard Meyer, what causes the listener's emotional response to","h":0.018903908656539348,"w":0.79012344360351561,"c":1},{"w":0.070009047190348284,"y":0.67725827299297725,"h":0.013216011937010053,"x":0.12754691711169217,"t":"music?","c":1},{"c":1,"t":"the way that the music evokes poignant memories in the listener","x":0.17072454915099144,"y":0.70293406165107353,"h":0.019097938133212811,"w":0.6153829447428385},{"h":0.01760393037110819,"y":0.72084341885924463,"w":0.58245905558268229,"x":0.17276638883320752,"c":1,"t":"the association of certain musical chords with certain feelings"},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"the listener's sympathy with the composer's intentions","y":0.73969375739734067,"c":1,"x":0.16872427690060021,"w":0.51851852416992184},{"t":"the internal structure of the musical composition","x":0.17283951288045529,"y":0.75726744168988402,"h":0.017467540902720735,"c":1,"w":0.45679011027018224},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.89094650179774915,"t":"69","y":0.93604651145584739,"c":1,"w":0.02880658467610675},{"c":1,"h":0.01645441358586508,"t":"leltsresources.org","w":0.20827172597249349,"x":0.39483721539984068,"y":0.96768258547277797}]}